title:Lose3
---
<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayMadL">>
<<PlaySound audio Loveday_Angry>>
<<Playsound audio Thud>>
Loveday: <b>ARE YOU KIDDING ME???</b> I was so CLOSE…! Maybe if I referred to my notes from the last fight… No…
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "ElsieScaredR">>
<<Playsound audio Elsie_Scared>>
Elsie: U-uh… Let’s calm down now…
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayMadL">>
<<PlaySound audio Loveday_Disgust>>
Loveday: How many more times do I have to experience the same damn loss?!
Loveday: It’s just like what they did before in Gailstad. It’s like nothing changed. If ANY damn vampire beats me again, I swear I’ll-
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>


<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "DahliaBaseL">>
Dahlia: Loveday.
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>


<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayMadL">>
<<PlaySound audio Loveday_Bother>>
<<Playsound audio Cloth2>>
Loveday: What are you doing?! Get your hands off m-
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>


<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "DahliaBaseL">>
<<PlaySound audio Dahlia_Damnit>>
<<Playsound audio Dread>>
Dahlia: LOVEDAY! <b>SNAP OUT OF IT.</b> Listen for just a minute, OKAY??
Dahlia: You’re our squad leader, and we listen to you. So calm down and think of a plan. 
<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "DahliaMadL">>
<<PlaySound audio Dahlia_Serious>>
Dahlia: And for crying out loud, remember that it’s not all about you. We’re in this together.
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>


<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayMadL">>
Loveday: …
<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayBaseL">>
<<PlaySound audio Loveday_Disgust>>
Loveday: Hmph. Okay. Well, for one thing…
Loveday: Elsie, control your breathing. Whenever you get shaky, your heals get weaker. Vera, your posture is your biggest detriment. If you duck a bit underneath your shield, our foes won’t be able to read your eyes. 
Loveday: And Dahlia, stop looking at Elsie right before you attack. You keep missing the enemy’s vital points because of that. 
<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayMadL">>
<<PlaySound audio Loveday_ComeOn>>
Loveday: In simpler terms, that <b>DAMNED</b> creature needs to be put to sleep.
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>


<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "VeraHappyR">>
<<PlaySound audio Vera_Agree>>
<<Playsound audio Interest>>
Vera: Awww! That’s the Loveday we know and love!! 
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "ElsieMadR">>
<<Playsound audio Elsie_Uncomfy>>
<<Playsound audio Question>>
