<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "ElsieScaredR">>
Elsie: Oooh wait, are we telling stories? Lili, my turn!  
Elsie: Once upon a time, there was a cute little girl in a dark, dark forest. She was sooo alone and scared. I mean, who wouldn’t be in a forest that dark and quiet? 
Elsie: T-Then, there was a loud WHOOOSH! And standing before her was a tall… pretty… tasty….. woma-  (HEARTBEAT)
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "DahliaBaseL">>
